{"applicability_conditions":null,"identity":{"block_id":"b0070","equation_id":"equation_015","equation_number":"15","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\n\\Theta_ {\\mathrm{D}} = \\frac {h}{K _ {\\mathrm{B}}} \\left[ \\frac {3 n}{4 \\pi} \\left(\\frac {N _ {\\mathrm{A}} \\rho}{M}\\right) \\right] ^ {1 / 3} v _ {\\mathrm{m}}\\tag{15}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1007_s12598-018-1074-2"},"latex":"\\Theta_{\\mathrm{D}} = \\frac{h}{K_{\\mathrm{B}}} \\left[ \\frac{3n}{4\\pi} \\left(\\frac{N_{\\mathrm{A}} \\rho}{M}\\right) \\right]^{1/3} v_{\\mathrm{m}}","purpose":"计算材料的德拜温度（Debye temperature），由理论密度、摩尔质量、平均声速等参数求得，用于评估化合物的热学性质与化学键行为。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"德拜温度（Debye temperature）","symbol":"\\Theta_{\\mathrm{D}}","unit":"K","value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"普朗克常数（Planck constant）","symbol":"h","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"玻尔兹曼常数（Boltzmann constant）","symbol":"K_{\\mathrm{B}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"每个分子式（化学式单元）中的原子数","symbol":"n","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"圆周率（数学常数）","symbol":"\\pi","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"阿伏伽德罗常数（Avogadro constant）","symbol":"N_{\\mathrm{A}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"理论密度（theoretical density）","symbol":"\\rho","unit":"kg·m^{-3}","value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"摩尔质量（molecular/molar mass）","symbol":"M","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"平均声速（average sound velocity）","symbol":"v_{\\mathrm{m}}","unit":"m·s^{-1}","value":null}],"unmapped":["Θ_D 的计算结果列于 Table 4：如 FeAl 为 652.5 K，MnAl 为 504.1 K，Fe_{1-x}Mn_xAl 系列介于两者之间。","v_m（平均声速）由 Eq. (16) 由横波声速 v_s 和纵波声速 v_l 计算得到；v_l 由 Eq. (17) 由体模量 B、剪切模量 G 和密度 ρ 计算得到。","该公式（Eq. (15)）与 Eqs. (16)–(18) 一起用于估算化学热学性质和化学键行为，文献来源为 [27, 29]。"]}